This source package is intended for the OrbiSys Ubuntu PPA, not direct upload
to the Ubuntu or Debian primary archives.

The Cargo dependencies are vendored in the upstream source archive so Launchpad
builds do not access the network. Each vendored crate retains its upstream
Cargo.toml and license files. Review the individual crate licenses before
proposing this package for an official distribution archive.

The PPA changelog currently targets Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (resolute). Change the
distribution in debian/changelog for another supported Ubuntu series and use a
unique Ubuntu package version for each series where required.
